\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 This PA between\u160 ?}{\f2\cf0\fs20 IBM Daksh Business Process Services Private Limited}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?(\'93Buyer\'94) and\u160 ?}{\f2\cf0\fs20 George P. Johnson Company}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?(\'93Supplier\'94) adopts and incorporates by reference all of the terms and conditions of the Base Agreement\u160 ?}{\f2\cf0\fs20 4913003041}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ? in effect as of the date hereof (\'93Base Agreement\'94) }{\ul\f2\cf0\fs20 and Statement of Work/Master Statement of Work* in effect as of the date hereof (\'93SOW\'94 / \'93Master SOW\'94) }{\f2\cf0\fs20 . This PA does not adopt and incorporate any amendments to the Base Agreement }{\ul\f2\cf0\fs20 and SOW/Master SOW*}{\f2\cf0\fs20  unless agreed to in writing by the parties to this PA.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\i\f2\cf0\fs20 If you are adopting related SOWs/Master SOW, add the following clause:\i0}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\ul\f2\cf0\fs20 However, any future amendments to the SOW/Master SOW referenced in this PA which affect price and part numbers for Deliverables are automatically incorporated and made a part of this PA.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\i\f2\cf0\fs20 *IF THE PA ALSO INCORPORATES EITHER THE SOW OR THE Master SOW, PLEASE INDICATE ABOVE. OTHERWISE, DELETE THE REFERENCE TO THE SOW \i0}{\i\f2\cf0\fs20 AND\i0}{\i\f2\cf0\fs20  THE Master SOW.\i0}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 A Work Authorization ("WA") may be issued under this PA by either the Buyer or any Affiliate of the Buyer.}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ? }{\f2\cf0\fs20 The Buyer or Affiliate of Buyer that issues a WA against this PA is referred to herein as the \'93Buyer Entity\'94.}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ? }{\f2\cf0\fs20 The Supplier or Affiliate of Supplier that accepts the WA from a Buyer Entity is referred to herein as the \'93Supplier Entity\'94.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 This PA and the Base Agreement }{\ul\f2\cf0\fs20 and }{\f2\cf0\fs20 SOW/Master SOW* establish the basis against which WAs may be issued by a Buyer Entity to a Supplier Entity.}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?\u160 ? }{\f2\cf0\fs20 This PA does not obligate Buyer, Buyer Entities, Supplier or Supplier Entities (or any of their respective Affiliates) to purchase or sell Deliverables, Products or Services.}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ? }{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 However, upon issuance of a WA against this PA by a Buyer Entity to a Supplier Entity, the Buyer Entity issuing the WA and the Supplier Entity in receipt thereof agree that purchases and sales of the Deliverables, Products or Services, as defined in the Base Agreement, will be conducted in accordance with, and be subject to, the terms and conditions of this PA, the Base Agreement and any applicable WA.}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ? }{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\b\f2\cf0\fs20 AMENDMENTS: \b0}{\f2\cf0\fs20 The following terms and conditions amend provisions of the Base Agreement to bring the conduct of the parties' transactions into conformity with local law and practice.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\ql\f2\cf0\fs20\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\ls3\fi0\ilvl0\s1\outlinelevel0\jclisttab\tx432\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\b\f2\cf0\fs20 Prior Communications and Order of Precedence\b0}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 In the event of any conflict between the terms of the Base Agreement and other documents, the order of precedence will be: (i) the quantity, payment and delivery terms of the relevant WA; (ii) the relevant SOW; (iii) this PA; (iv) the Base Agreement; and (v) the remaining terms of the relevant WA.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs20\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\ql\f2\cf0\fs20\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\ls3\fi0\ilvl0\s1\outlinelevel0\jclisttab\tx432\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\b\f2\cf0\fs20 Choice of\u160 ?Forum\b0}{\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 This PA will be governed by the laws of the country where the Buyer Entity entering into the relevant WA is located, except in:}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (a)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 Australia}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , then the parties to the WA agree to submit to the non-exclusive \u160 ?jurisdiction of the courts of }{\f2\cf0\fs20 New South Wales}{\f2\cf0\fs20 .\u160 ? }{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (b)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 China}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , notwithstanding Section 14.3 of the Base Agreement, all disputes arising out of or in connection with this Agreement shall be settled by the parties through friendly negotiation. In the event said disputes can not be settled through friendly negotiation, either Party may submit the dispute to arbitration to be conducted by China International Economic and Trade Arbitration Commission in }{\f2\cf0\fs20 Beijing}{\f2\cf0\fs20  in accordance with its then current arbitration rules. The arbitration tribunal shall be composed of three (3) arbitrators. The arbitral award shall be final and binding. This PA will be governed by the laws of the People\rquote s Republic of }{\f2\cf0\fs20 China}{\f2\cf0\fs20 . }{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (c)Hong Kong, then the parties agree that the laws of Hong Kong, Special Administrative Region shall govern in construing the provisions of this PA and the parties agree to submit any disputes arising from this PA to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of }{\f2\cf0\fs20 Hong Kong}{\f2\cf0\fs20 .}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (d)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 Korea}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , then the parties to the WA agree to submit to the jurisdiction of the Seoul Central District Court.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (e)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 New Zealand}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , then the parties agree to submit to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of }{\f2\cf0\fs20 New Zealand}{\f2\cf0\fs20 . }{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\f2\cf0\fs20 (f)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 Singapore}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , then the parties agree to submit any disputes arising from this PA to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of }{\f2\cf0\fs20 Singapore}{\f2\cf0\fs20 .}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (g)}{\f2\cf0\fs20 Taiwan}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , the parties agree that this PA shall be governed by the laws of the Republic of China and Taipei District Court shall be the court of first instance for disputes arising from this PA.}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\qj\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 (h) }{\f2\cf0\fs20 Indonesia}{\f2\cf0\fs20 , the parties agree that disputes arising out of or in connection with this PA shall be finally settled by arbitration which shall be held in }{\f2\cf0\fs20 Jakarta, Indonesia}{\f2\cf0\fs20  in accordance with the rules of Board of the Indonesian National Board of Arbitration (Badan Arbitrase Nasional Indonesia or \'93BANI\'94) then in effect. The arbitration award shall be final and binding for the parties without appeal and shall be in writing and set forth the findings of fact and the conclusions of law. }{\qj\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

\pard\ql\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 {\f2\cf0\fs20 \u160 ?}{\ql\f2\cf0\fs24\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0 \par}

